{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_07",
  "title": "夢的餘韻",
  "storyCode": "NL-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e4c97d42cf061540f5e4ee66a29e97941022de1683c0b70e8a88bc69abc19707",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 7-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣了，征戰騎士的目的地是哪裡？監正院嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們去了，冠軍牆展廳，歷代冠軍掛像與頒獎之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼？他們不應該立刻去政府那邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "董事會正在討論此事。在我看來，這是監正會試圖挽回顏面的一步棋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許下一步......也許下一步，他們會嘗試讓駐軍成為常態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在的卡西米爾，可不是他們把刀架在別人脖子上就說了算的......愚昧的騎士還沒能意識到這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴力的時代早就過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦你另外走一趟零號地塊了，斷電對感染者收容治療中心的影響很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去看一看那裡有沒有出什麼問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告，發言人閣下，電力系統......基本恢復了！正在準備重啟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G06"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑暗中的銀光一路行過。\n嘈雜的觀眾圍繞著這一場奢華的登場。\n路燈撲閃，隨即，霓虹色彩回到了這座小睡片刻的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "銀槍的天馬在廣告燈光的簇擁下顯得格格不入。\n但是，在場的每一個人，湊熱鬧的路人、慌張的騎士、興奮的遊客......\n他們都產生了錯覺，他們都認為，是天馬帶來了光。\n是城市在他們的身後，逐步恢復活力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......見過伊奧萊塔宗師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許久不見，萊姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長途跋涉辛苦了，但可惜，我們似乎沒有什麼時間休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不需要休息，為卡西米爾掃清污穢才是當務之急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵......你還是老樣子，這麼性急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想去見一見這場宴會的主角嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......瑪嘉烈·臨光？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當年她就不應該拒絕宗師的邀請，她本會是我們中最優秀的一批，而不用淪落至此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，她再次回到卡西米爾，卻重新站上了那種虛偽的擂台......莫非流放讓瑪嘉烈改變了想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也是和瑪嘉烈決鬥過的，你覺得她是那樣的孩子嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......但時間能改變一切，瑪嘉烈如今......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這面牆，萊姆，特錦賽的歷代冠軍們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼從這個逐漸崩潰的時代中脫穎而出的騎士，他們依舊能蘊含光芒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只出現一兩位優秀的騎士，並不能說明什麼，宗師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士競技依舊只是純粹的褻瀆，是卡西米爾的禍根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一次回到大騎士領，我都更加悲哀憤懣，我們的人民正在喪失敬畏，高尚的品德反倒成了迂腐的笑話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也許吧，自從征戰騎士離開大騎士領後，就一直如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊奧萊塔·羅素",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜時代在年輕人手上，我們得出的答案，已經無關緊要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......原來博士你已經察覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們不能在卡西米爾的中心做得太過火。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭和各位幹員的安全才是第一考量。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我想各位都不會同意我們輕舉妄動。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白，本來，臨光也不希望我們在特錦賽期間還回到你的身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我從當地感染者口中得到的消息越來越不可忽視......我認為，阿米婭和博士應該知道這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，閃靈小姐的判斷是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果感染者真的在零號地塊遭到了......某種不人道的待遇，那我們就不該以“安危”為藉口袖手旁觀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......博士的顧慮也有道理......卡西米爾和烏薩斯、龍門都不同......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "想像一下。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們現在炸毀設施，救出所有感染者，逃離卡西米爾。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......暴力是不可行的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "一旦真的越過了那條線，羅德島頃刻間就會淹沒在卡西米爾的力量之中。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我們身處卡西米爾的中央。也許這個國度與烏薩斯有本質上的不同，但......這裡還是騎士之國。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "無論它的內部矛盾激化到了什麼地步，它仍舊是卡西米爾。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "羅德島絕不能與它為敵。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我們立刻去和聯合會洽談，花錢買下所有的感染者。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "啊......羅、羅德島應該做不到吧......？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "就算真的用錢買下了所有的感染者......在這之後呢？難道大騎士領就不會出現新的感染者了嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "而且，這只會單純地讓感染者變成......可交易的商品。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "這解決不了什麼問題。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我們馬上向國民院檢舉揭發此事，寄希望於監正會。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "監正會......我們還不知道零號地塊的全貌。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "監正會和商業聯合會的博弈從未停止過，監正會對於感染者的態度也是模棱兩可......也許監正會從一開始就默許了呢？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "羅德島......真的還能做到些什麼嗎？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "用他們的辦法，解決他們的問題。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那邊！追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（電力已經恢復了......索娜應該會想辦法回去集合才對。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "立刻通知增援——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從這裡轉個彎——唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本來在零號地塊待得好好的......突然一下燈就黑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為無胄盟終於不願意給哨站的房子付電費了，結果就收到了支援請求......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......白金！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......又是你嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真希望上一次你和焰尾騎士已經吃夠苦頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾......我是越挨打，越反抗的類型。"
