      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不長記性......那只好給你點顏色看看了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（被拉開了距離——只要擋住這一箭就能找到反擊的機會！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡！幫助白金大位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（糟——背後——！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_216",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......！打碎了路燈嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......要是被玻璃劃破臉可怎麼辦......真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查絲汀娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "灰毫，快撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會想辦法拖住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖......礙事，先找到掩體，確認方位......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "制式輕弩的射擊距離不會太遠......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，而且有兩個人嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遠牙，她好像察覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
