    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（停火了......轉移了嗎？敏銳的傢伙。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（早知道這麼麻煩我就當沒聽見求援了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（但是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "閉上眼。\n白金突然回想起了很久以前，父母對自己說過的話。\n他們說，她敏銳的視力一定會為家族帶來榮耀。\n現在，她榮耀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住你了，瑟奇亞克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風暴般掠過的箭矢劃過瑟奇亞克的臉龐。\n只差一點，他的腦袋就很難保持完整了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——她反擊了？這麼遠的距離！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生什麼了？瑟奇亞克？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖！別停下，繼續移動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吁——呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......下一箭，送給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......特製的箭頭......可怕的威力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼複雜的城市地形，她還能準確捕捉到我們的動向嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是逃走了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可沒打算......就這麼逃走，白金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你......把我的家人怎麼了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把他們怎麼了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......遠距離行不通，就改近身搏殺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想得真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多狼狽啊......一位父親，因為反抗無胄盟落到如此下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你這——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有殺你的妻子和孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你把他們藏在哪了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你願意聽從無胄盟的安排，甚至可以先和他們通個電話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你是要我出賣紅松騎士團？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是一位父親......還是一位騎士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有必要為感染者做到這一步嗎？瑟奇亞克？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白金大位......到此為止了。這個距離，你的動作再快也快不過箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......選擇吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個個的......都不把騎士放在眼裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何人參加騎士競技都能成為騎士，只不過老牌騎士家族更容易一些罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所謂的騎士......只是......讓人失望的一場夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerId": "char_204_platnm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你的自尊心比你的家人還重要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我根本不打算相信你，下作的殺手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動手！遠牙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路上已經恢復秩序了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是一場大動亂啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......會是索娜她們做的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也許，有其他人推波助瀾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們內心充滿憤怒與不公，她們想要反抗，感染者的反抗......最後卻遭人利用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的慘劇......我經歷過許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......瑪嘉烈，你想要幫助她們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為感染者而戰，和以騎士身份而戰，在如今的卡西米爾，這是兩個互相矛盾的選擇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——感染者所遭遇的不公，只是無數苦難在我們眼前的縮影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信有人會去為感染者伸張正義，而且，我也相信他們一定能夠做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但只靠我們去拯救是不行的。只靠那些已經覺醒了堅定意志的人去拯救，是不夠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_nearllivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......稀客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下，久疏問候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別對我行禮，我甚至連騎士都不是，別忘了你的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你是來找瑪嘉烈的，那可能要讓你失望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很多年沒有回過大騎士領，英雄的家，已經變成這副模樣了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那對姐妹已經不住在這裡了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，失禮......這是您的家庭問題，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有別的事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪恩納閣下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別那麼叫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人可以貶低您，我們不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使瑪嘉烈誤入歧途，她的妹妹還尚且年幼，但臨光家族可不是靠著歷史和名聲來博得尊敬的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些自詡精英的商人們就是洞察不到這一本質，才會對騎士們的種種行為感到不解，呸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是看到您身體安康，也令人安心幾分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我現在這副模樣？少說客套話吧，騎士閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您真為我著想，就請回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪恩納閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“銀槍的天馬”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_224",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請允許我們，向您......不，向臨光家族致以最崇高的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......英雄已經落幕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個普通的卡西米爾人，當得起銀槍皮加索斯的鄭重行禮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是個奇妙的夜晚。博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經快日出了，很抱歉我沒能第一時間趕來，聯合會總是有很多事情需要處理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "您是怎麼看待零號地塊的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以當作您這番話......沒有弦外之音嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是個聰明人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "很遺憾。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您覺得......大騎士領如此對待感染者，是一件合理的舉措嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您無需回答，你我都知道答案——折衷的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我們做不出最完美最富有人性的選擇，又不願選擇最血腥最原始的答案時，這就是結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這並不合理，馬克維茨先生。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道嗎......其實如果您讀過一些卡西米爾的史書，您就會意識到，我們如今的社會建立在怎樣的“不合理”上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也許不瞭解......在天馬的國度因夢魘帶來的動盪被推翻，騎士團立國之後，是扈從們最先真正團結了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扈從們為騎士運作財產，為騎士打理土地，之後，扈從們又聯起手來，將那些暴虐無道的大騎士們趕下了台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在呢？商業聯合會豢養著殺手組織與競技騎士，而被豢養的一方則永遠會奮起反抗，試圖擺脫權力的桎梏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......歷史就是一個循環，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前的發言人做了一些齷齪的勾當，也因此付出了代價，現在，輪到我處於這個位置，艱苦前行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些東西，符合您的道德觀念嗎？它，“合理”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道您是怎麼知道的......但您應該已經察覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對那些在賽場上重度傷殘的、礦石病加劇到無法遏制的，聯合會選擇了......人道處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不合理？當然，我也想說“不行”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但難道要我們永遠養著那些感染者病人嗎？這種無法解決的疾病......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "礦石病一天不能被“治癒”，那我們就一天做不到和平共處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "“處理”那些仍然掙扎求生的人，這叫謀殺。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凡是覺得不合理的人都被排除了，這才造就了每一段合理的歷史，所幸我已經接受了這個道理，您難道不明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這是在試圖挑戰卡西米爾......我不建議您這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也許確實有別的辦法。如果您能想到什麼，我願意幫助您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨夜大斷電的首要嫌疑人，就是感染者騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如，只是假如，假如斷電引發了一場車禍，或是讓一位依賴家庭呼吸機的老人停止了呼吸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道出於幫助感染者的立場，我們就要對這些悲劇，也視而不見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "允許感染者大批出現在賽場上，所有人都為此承擔了許多壓力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而這股壓力正來自於社會本身，而不是某個人、某個團體，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但現在，感染者在死去，我們在袖手旁觀。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "此時此刻，有很多人在非正常地死亡，疾病，天災，我們幫不了所有人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "很抱歉。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "您說得對，“我們也許確實有別的辦法”。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......是的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "如果您有什麼想法......我相信，您可以做到一些事情。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "但請記住我說的話，不要把這件事當做一件好似扶老人過馬路一般的事情去對待。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "零號地塊的矛盾是十分複雜的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......抱歉，也許是我話說得太重了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
              "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "您能冷靜下來思考一下，對我們都有好處。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人想要見您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我就不打擾您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別誤會......如果可能，我還是希望站在您這邊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，要從無數的“不合理”和“無能為力”之中，把最可能的答案選出來，是一件很困難的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說得對......大斷電，耀騎士，血騎士，這也許反而給了那些感染者騎士抗爭的意志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在事情一發不可收拾之前，希望你我能避免太多的......傷亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“好人能有一個好下場”，在如今，已經是一件需要去爭取才能實現的事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
